        },
        {
          "text": "Nebateke dibendele dia tshitudilu tshia Lubena ku luseke lua ku sude. Elisu muana mulume wa Shedeu neikale mukelenge wa bana ba Lubena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
