        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba mu tshisamba tshia Manashe nebashikame hehi nʼandi. Gamaliele muana mulume wa Pedasu neikale mukelenge wa bana ba Manashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
